{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1344,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2e8c902de1255a77b98e826",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴画的图就跟她本人一样，\r\n既温暖又柔和……\r\n我非常喜欢她的画。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7ce83b6cfbab5173f3380a7352983a45d42d37c2aad45eae8b09f5495fa72d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8545993b4f0b0160c15cde21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在别人面前唱歌很害羞，\r\n但又彷佛变成受人称赞的英雄，\r\n感觉好复杂啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d2903369dcab13809eb1858a9fd0a41c77177cb985f45f1ae8c3137bcf963c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa1ee880ef39fb32cfaba678",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我满擅长……唱带有叙事口吻的\r\n歌曲。那会让我想到吟游诗人，\r\n帮助我更加投入感情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a07053bdc6fc2666a91fc3df86eabf734c5a66b45ca5e1c696981aa06519f8bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baf8a77ca927034203821480",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这决胜服灵感来自「罗布・罗伊」，\r\n是最强的服装……！\r\n但愿我有表现出……其威严与风范。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a747d85829a87d7ecb91824119818cdd01b21b2cbf0e25b31c64673312145f4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af7f76263948b0eadff975b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上决胜服令我觉得又离憧憬的英雄\r\n更近了一步……不管什么比赛\r\n我都一定没问题……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "adc68feae7b874ad403c3f5175f533f31d5d46bdfb7dc3ffd5d4f9e4936e3c6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52ef0ac15fb0e6fc2be3dbfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很早起……？我的确都会\r\n提早一点时间上学。这样一来\r\n还能趁开始上课前先读点书喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fefcad98a2abb028fbcbf322b26849c649a35ecc62135b1dd35ce47ebbc8d352",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d240e0430a0f6c145e907029",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "中午时间餐厅人潮汹涌……我常常\r\n不小心绊倒。唯一值得庆幸的是\r\n很少有人注意到我……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f14b823eabc50f9289b3ee63f01062d717cdac685fa016a49a4f1afd11ea7d7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6abdec9ac8a181e2078e7d25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴只要看到我熬夜就会\r\n露出非常担心的表情……\r\n晚上读书时得多注意控制时间了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6d16615026ad5c1f7fb0eae7e0d75cf74c1dd85d0806d412fd049ea1e763555",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a02124fb75eb9dd9e386975",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的存在感太低了……入学典礼那天\r\n负责导览的前辈都没注意到我……\r\n如果……现在有改善一点就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "438610977aaccaf21d272dd047553e080463c7b6c94bed738c6f5ad3a65cd8ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceddbcb25e0d888a28d80949",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜……竟然晒出了眼镜痕……\r\n最近这阵子我无论遇到什么事\r\n都不会拿下眼镜的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61a39ac285ff5095db2bb298d2c986eff71563e691bbd0273bfc78b05973065a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73c17899445065408d2abd91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天气温凉爽，湿度也低……\r\n对我跟书本来说\r\n都是很舒适的季节。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5912b7916fc0d60b399221fb81d4b1677577812f880c792d0c1003e5359faf12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e1e004117570c2f0c6d6c39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道《冰雪女王》这个故事吗？\r\n勇敢的吉尔达拥有永不放弃的精神，\r\n她是我最喜欢的故事主角之一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e12629bd163d1b28986896d8ccfb37a8aa0ce4f6111438e9c36450a5f8703f4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:259d056d35617d629739e5fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "読書がしたくなったら言って\r\nくださいね。かばんの中に\r\nいつでも本を入れていますので！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c5a71e4db04e732fb2840a9b304fc734c21c55143e83288e7889c1170c3760f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5297352de1c5e51c654dd226",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヒシミラクルさんと話すとほっと\r\nするんですよね♪あの癒し力は\r\nなかなか真似できません。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea2b18f661feca85e609cda4d437acabfc11e6d70d6943a804babd9e87171523",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d855ee84692098171a785d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スティルさんとユニさんと私、\r\n3人がかりでようやく自動ドアが\r\n反応しました…！よ、よかった…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "131226fab4a62303e0932c6cf7e5ddc34ae41752f33776b60c3e00ef7615509e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a29441d002143a2ff1dcc487",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユニさんの眼鏡姿、素敵だなぁ…！\r\n知的でカッコよくて！おそろいに\r\nできて嬉しいです。ふふっ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "977fb30f7c1238a026277ab008309cbcad6a970bc967dae1ef180a1fe66f3159",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:450e178ef8672059a0a73688",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天球儀…はさすがに寮の部屋には\r\n置けないかな…？ちょっとだけ\r\nライスさんに相談してみようかな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "863f0628c1d71e287502a7cf2fe7347044e3c6e9213c82b784c5038d1d4246f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c74560f0c54a372a19313c25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "髪の毛、ハネてません…よね？\r\n縛っていることが多いので、\r\nおろしていると少しだけ心配で。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3645c76e5ba72bbac33c32c171744f6d64f4138015eb72f6516ef059492b2119",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2203d351d64944ce1bc2439",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タップさんへのおすすめ本、しぼり\r\nきれない…っ！海賊の冒険譚に、\r\n旅人の探検記、詩人の放浪記も…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb2cf7cf97708d1920fa425fdfaf2541f5b5d4baa63b5a17f9fe9fc706d37c97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32e26b30faed6ffe5b5a7e89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜空を見にいくのはいかが\r\nでしょう…？その、星座にまつわる\r\n逸話などお話しできるかと…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b785ea4f9167884ff7e9e05d0e03622ad1f8d749fe7800efdb371acb4b543d77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aba44e5c6e908e4023443cd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花言葉は神話に基づいていることが\r\n多いんですが…あの、もしご興味が\r\nあればお話ししても…っ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2d18bac72bd73f2ee1bf1a985be8702c42de9d8e6360907295eaef67fe2d348",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3519145844917b46144f5d2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏の読書はハンカチが必須ですね…\r\n汗で本を汚してしまうのは、\r\nたいへん忍びないですから…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "498d9b716336847593863409b1107a7c853d2f7af30d5c60e67dc067dad4c218",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fd961087599b36be3f7066d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この季節は不思議と力が湧いてくる\r\n気がするんです。読書の秋だから\r\nでしょうか？それとも…――",
      "source_fingerprint": "8466108a38bdf2e529e4c0c608f68a6aa070699daa25e2192c7c608d4c7bfa69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cdbf61da658975879622de1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒い日は熱血なヒーローの物語に\r\n限りますねっ。心が燃えて、\r\n体まで温かくなってきます♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6f9f1a7509dd5f69bdaa1519d43f33ace64770804007b0c1920cf40e9c18ddc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0473ff29949f61cbd9f54d89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可愛いですよね、まるで物語の中の\r\nお嬢様のようで――あ、\r\nもちろん服のこと、です…っ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df85d727db7c3018e63d3e3da67697f5b9c21a731204538e42367a6450edfddc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13b08d19ee81c25ebcc60673",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家族に写真を送ったら、『オシャレ\r\nさんだね』って返事が来ました。\r\n選んでくれたユニさんに感謝です♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4adceb0b481fba31bec9ffce8ae23d88a949bf5e426abcf489e5dd96f3ad1851",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b287bf7eef2c1ef15d527ce7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了成为英雄，\r\n今天也要向前迈进……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44345ba9f00f5c67ecec6683eca6f0e86438b3b4513a96ff153ee4c8a8483527",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e73efa23a66feb93a0deb66a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いきますっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0ee723306ea339f8c53c617bbeb0d8bbc8544bca51ccba4a801db3248f22b95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2ccd26aa71e700d315d4134",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "换言之，训练就是修行……\r\n那些声名显赫的勇者们一定也是\r\n像这样不停努力修行过来的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8120f6210482cdc37fbe68e6ee6bc2e428e2ea606b2a69d4b77b0189a360318a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f8a0b63a7fe426f5b596a55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好的。\r\n我完成图书委员的工作了，\r\n随时都可以开始训练……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbb3a5db341dae34a60a683f5fdc96f4037133dd155b6d3154a82d98f109a21d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4259cec7008f4155631104b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想改变自己……\r\n所以，无论什么训练\r\n我都必须尝试……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3091cd41426e696aace0c684e8052dd78dc8804aeafea68db66eb8acf184422a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f1d398e26b74b58b9ca2494",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员你也知道，我的执着\r\n比别人强一倍，从不轻言放弃。\r\n我要尽力坚持到最后一刻……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1fd4a3ef5deeb843470aad3a0275a89486d91e0fc1c3365ca0bc10e849acd96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c0f340a88c7c4411892e038",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我必须变得足以完成\r\n任何训练才行……\r\n可不能在读者面前出糗啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29522f3c2f965426ade73e722536ea4887c827ce96d8b607ca44df345c5e4e4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2416fde0c6a935296188c1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "眼前这个时刻也是我的\r\n英雄传说的一个重要篇章。\r\n请跟我一同继续谱写故事……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1a173cf8db0a4c610fe5498c9effe198121e4e2ffb59609d7053dad8d8875c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec05131baadd9a92d625b073",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "环境变化常常是\r\n故事发展上的转折点。\r\n真希望我也有所成长……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d313437b93e0ee048a76d98d5af4556bfeca1537e91f87ea8b081e0801c35ac1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:999c18b9840f63d02e443f00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私自身の物語を紡ぐため、\r\n今日も全力で取り組みます…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3256c87cc865e57f5edbd3c88ef8d3cca3457a23d11bed6922f9d5e8d4362efa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4960563cc94f541f5b67e5ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヒールにも慣れてきたので、\r\nきちんと走れるかとっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4738f25603ee394adcce7448e6c952556c8d688fa59293d6891b11f25c6ce0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31fcd2e6b5ec980d583c1b24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あ、本はきちんとかばんから\r\n出してきました。左右のバランスに\r\n影響するかなと思って…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6caba95ee847eb28048e70c8357e283592259392985dce09d3f958fde073195",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e527afd2327035a0c5686919",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イメージトレーニングは\r\nできています。あとは\r\n実践するだけ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "766d0eca55533becab8abd1a37052659e23b18ff4cdd1c0f0aaae3c00af38f6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b13d4e0095fec380a8803b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ネイルってあまりしたことが\r\nなかったんですが…華やかな気分に\r\nなるものなんですね。ふふふっ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab38fcf1cbfb9df6786e62edc3c56decc14f4fcaf53d27eb8d69338059306e5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a169189d05acaa358bd7d5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "星座には英雄の名前がつけられる\r\nこともありますし、私も\r\n活躍し続ければいずれは…なんて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58625ae2536cf1f97eddce0f968a39d13e5e7382c43c38b9f4cd96c6f81080a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06e5184c889c305e96e38761",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もっともっと強くなりたいです…！\r\n『英雄』の名を、\r\n誰にも譲らないために――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe71a28955077a9d93b021b59e10ce3e068be0c2702535f9f0a9e79abaa90077",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f803e53075511042fd508ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也会在英雄传说中留名，\r\n并与英雄一同受到未来世人传唱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c4881207a0fb20a6fce3edbc830e4563e36ff7eb9116d492c2ef705deeb5889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8810db579689692f974cae3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是……\r\n由我们一同创造的故事呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f213c8780143f7cbd748c2fbd74b97b26c3a61caba0b2b00a2aa77db8d7395d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ed4b4a1614c16355080856f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんな星々よりも、輝けたと思います！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77bd1108ef34148575bfe0bcff8b3e7465bd348926c83c39ad185b96f580e046",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af0ddc4f171feede315f3665",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私からの感謝…『伝わっている』でしょうか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ee170ed51b5039ba6fb5757775643bf164905802e6b77a8f5dfbae39e7f0c20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26905492816ab6213c504606",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的我是不是\r\n离「罗布・罗伊」更近一步了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "335ace40ac811f465a9fa4e819ab5f760f400505ba0352cf482b96ef0eb5cfef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c89eaf5e5b74b7f8067c554f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是我的潜能──\r\n迈向荣耀的路标……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10a21727331be53b1369906820c514d1953b48134d501e46ea720a3d0264bfcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7ba4c6041e1b8828305f794",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我叫荒漠英雄，\r\n是、是未来的英雄……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dc58757aac58329d4d441320aaffed71c495cfdebf745951a47b0f031f4a631",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:319eda54bd6c6ef61f9f97a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请见证我的轨迹──\r\n我成为英雄的历程……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ce8b5c332acdfd83382f84bfac7e9b9f1ef44c63aa7ec368daca4f77e2504c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9065f6789332e41087f3cfb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃，教怎么替人声援的书在……",
      "source_fingerprint": "13a0560153936bd286c17ffe00209db1315f25f0910b9cd9d9b7ff8a123b44e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dd6fd79ccde9e066b56703b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想要能帮上……更多忙！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e94f6753e490a71c512ae2ac717de052421018afbb102e2bc4ba321458c91d52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a5d68aa071d2fb20d25366d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "星々のきらめきを！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e6d9a38564c7c1dcd2ef865b5e2d87c7f75fbe6a22557aae111681126ec0f0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdd93f0e94333cc89a96d789",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天高く、あの空の彼方まで！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94c87f0d22157c25df1fb0154ad1f3ff40cc9e6d6e11d35d035b54ca261b5a88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bd8a98e88c40ae75cb484ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まだ見ぬ星の大海へ――\r\nさあ、大冒険の始まりです！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b16d3536460c9853ba4ab5d108940cf446dd15aa2b8dccb2658002806cea4108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc58a0961e4c17c3cccd3546",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ゼンノロブロイです。\r\n共に物語を紡ぎたいです…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d82efa40e8479cc71ba362ab29c476e5863b07e70eaaea26fcd90259e47c1bd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02030d090543355af27e6d8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会全力以赴，多指教～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b31bf94f0b5da2bc9b6ea5ef2fd89a601bd65593d8aa9a428e423405b43e67f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ff726d285b611fea876c20f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你是因为担任我的签约训练员，\r\n所以才没被开除的喔。\r\n你大可好好感谢我喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b674e958df4ec3762c8256bcce3f787db8e8224de0bdab686e8a9d63c9fe5a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:593c11f38eb8755f131cc87d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくる～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bf42b9fd5da35c63a63524ed5a9bf173886319dd560821b82879a41a7ddedb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:270cded0a32a4865d8406777",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9d600edd4c987f3247b3090a622080abe8e88308dcf78eded0477be4bf5d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:133a2bb6ee54c9c5a5c83c4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然知道你是个奇怪的人……\r\n但这样也挺有趣的，\r\n或许我也跟你是同类吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3f9e975652112ee1dc6274523e71700246f85ed84ef0ae93fb4efa4331f4e61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9bebb81ce941194414cfd3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸～你都还有在关注流行趋势吗？\r\n表演一下你最新的搞笑梗吧，\r\n我帮你拍下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6244f9d6c2b2a12a5fba97724b5e2d4d435c01498bc5587f3da81a610d2ebf1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1538ac09872dae57fdd0119",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年～恭喜～\r\n话说是要恭喜什么？\r\n……恭喜有红包？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ecf83d6ab7c80019deeb343bb5c5743462f2d3f59e16ca36eb53349ccc7a61c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96e95b7ee3bdc5db9d0e1fc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐～训练员，\r\n来交换巧克力吧。\r\n就算是超市买的也行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3105d67246c1dbe50a6ac61977ab5544c2948c0f49159468068e666169c0208e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d0997b3eaa32593cd968fe4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在也不流行手工巧克力了吧？\r\n不过感觉你会喜欢这种的，\r\n想要的话……就做吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4af35795a0098eb2948bb47e4f431282a10ccd67516aedbc2ff73e19a9f32d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d451641b27ff1fe286a25f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很有七夕感的美甲也好可爱～♪\r\n训练员也要弄吗？把手伸出来！\r\n我用亮片帮你弄得闪亮亮的☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "69f0cb111d4c28f1f71dd874e70d7fcf152ebdce82b26f18a7b4c2c7d0438a65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bb3a6e05fb692f5a0e099ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很多人都来拜托我帮忙\r\n做万圣节派对变装的美甲♪呵呵，\r\n我真的是开店赚钱会比较好吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0bafee0c3d12294bcf6be5cd9ed4ccd8d1efa0a3e1afd88051902f02d36f83e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbbe2357dba1b9e25b59c19b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞派对被搞得像是个\r\n普通的祭典了耶。\r\n阿船她们刚才竟然敲了太鼓。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5460dfd7c7bc8e4ecc71e0f9c0447ae593aca1454fee40ff6882b5b828a2d79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdef3e84ec05fc427f797c07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在圣诞节跑来见我\r\n也太闲了吧。拿你没办法，\r\n总之要先去买蛋糕吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ae2b29e19a10aa55b4f9ce48ee005966063d91633a1007d3d7478500c3a4fa0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae69b2478d6513d29840feb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欧耶──☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd321ef123f1cf69395eb00b8bec7430e1a76a6664b5a394124f05048660063c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad47ead03d4d7d1ca6f33dab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸，说起来腊月是什么？\r\n是腊八粥的同伴吗？\r\n所以这季节的东西很好吃吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "36afc8af8b1bd6e261e78338d97518667b5d2d07d4a94ac200d256557c9aacb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92790bf5ddcc684c41268c51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，生日快乐～\r\n送你家庭餐厅的折价券，\r\n我们一起去吃吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c114ba271b9b44b0f4be54effd803f56cd0f8b9579ea4cbe64169f785cb1e2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ff4495adc53700e7f599be9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员把手伸出来，手。\r\n帮你的指甲涂上和我决胜服同样的\r\n颜色作为生日礼物～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b25053f3914e02754af726a7368443ad8efe81f89d53e639c1fd4d1747f81def",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:010c1bc7cda6509c8df15a28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家好像要帮我举办庆生派对，\r\n给我一个惊喜……\r\n哈哈，超级明显也太好笑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed4ad0be372a1fa9524d5e3c7c876a6bffbb4b3bcabecd065c6ef2159673ab96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e0b88f09a6b173c7d1162be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有个限生日当天才能\r\n拿到的特典彩绘指甲，\r\n所以陪我一起去趟美甲店吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28c2dcfa7bf5a84cae84bff19c75e3d8c50f9eea9128b7279d4bbdd9e8541ebf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8ba51bca2f3b6ab7bb6e757",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新的公告咯。\r\n给它已读一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a054183a7ea5619ad1e76404c3142cbfb29fba0bc9d48215fbd18c81bbc2c50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb15469e13216580a395ba0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，有礼物耶。\r\n不拿白不拿，\r\n快收下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b93fedb212747919c91a945acec742a593375f5bbcb1afcc6edd5e7a35ff32f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:421b3b254ca3e1274bbe34c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶──\r\n完成任务～\r\n恭喜恭喜恭喜～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e43719f16925fa4be8b528d3a0e0368af5dfc6b28ba3c962cd3194d7c630ed2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df86a784a414b27dd45112ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有什么活动。\r\n并不是我很有干劲啦，\r\n只是有点好奇～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2a64d69b8443f8fea31cc70166b87817f3506df0e2893a3873ee31dd04a8770",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:156292c56e1ed8affa808fbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动现正举办中～☆\r\n要参加的话，\r\n我来上传到Umatok吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0313b134d7259f8a534c7728a2b06760d4c71ea927a7bf7af2159ef19d39924e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "10019"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
